# DESHILL — Gene Launch 002

**Network:** Solana
**Launch Infrastructure:** Meteora Dynamic Bonding Curve (DBC)
**Gene Project:** 002

---

## Overview

DESHILL is Gene's first launch with an allocation.

Gene's previous launches held nothing back. This one does:

**23% of supply never reaches the bonding curve — 3% team, 20% airdrop.**

Both amounts and both destination wallets are published below, before launch. Neither can move until the token graduates.

DESHILL launches through a Meteora Dynamic Bonding Curve and automatically graduates to DAMM v2. There is no protection window on this launch — the fee is a flat 1% from the very first trade.

