### What this means

Gene holds back **230,000,000 DESHILL**: 30,000,000 for the team and 200,000,000 for the airdrop. Those tokens are configured on-chain as supply the curve never sells. Gene receives no privileged first purchase.

Buyers on the bonding curve are sold **570,000,000 DESHILL (57% of supply)**. A further **200,000,000 (20%)** is migrated into the graduated pool.

The token is immutable under the configured token authority, and the graduated liquidity allocated under this configuration is permanently locked rather than withdrawable by Gene.

