## The Held-Back Allocation

The 230,000,000 held-back tokens are **not** bought off the curve, **not** minted later, and **not** sitting in a wallet during the launch. They are configured on-chain as tokens the bonding curve never sells.

Until the token graduates, **Meteora's program refuses to release them.**

That is the important part. For the entire life of the bonding curve — while every buyer is still on it — none of the team or airdrop allocation can be sold, moved or transferred by anyone, including Gene. It is enforced by the program, not by a promise.

