## The Airdrop

The airdrop allocation is **200,000,000 DESHILL (20% of supply)**.

It is held back by the same mechanism as the team allocation: the tokens are configured on-chain as supply the bonding curve never sells, they cannot be released until the token graduates, and at graduation they are sent to the publicly disclosed airdrop wallet below in one transaction.

What is committed to at the mechanical level:

- The airdrop wallet receives exactly **200,000,000 DESHILL** and no more
- It is a **publicly disclosed address**, so every distribution out of it is permanently visible on-chain
- Nothing can be distributed before the token graduates

**Distribution specifics — eligibility, weighting and schedule — are published separately.**

There is no claim date, no guaranteed eligibility, and no promise that any particular wallet receives anything.

